flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B{Is it?}
    B -->|Yes| C[OK]
    C --> D[Rethink]
    D --> B
    B ---->|No| E[End]
    A --> F[Load config]
    F --> G{Valid?}
    G -->|no| H[Report error]
    G -->|yes| I[Connect]
    I --> J[Fetch users]
    I --> K[Fetch orders]
    I --> L[Fetch products]
    J & K & L --> M[Merge]
    M --> N{Any conflicts?}
    N -->|yes| O[Resolve] --> M
    N -->|no| P[Write report]
    P --> Q[(Archive)]
    P --> R[Notify]
    R --> S[Email]
    R --> T[Slack]
    R --> U[Webhook]
    H --> E
    S & T & U --> E
    subgraph checks[Checks]
        V1[Schema] --> V2[Types] --> V3[Ranges]
    end
    G --> V1
    V3 --> I
